  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9941a663",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can see that the different deployments have a bit of a longtailed distribution - I wonder if it would be acceptable to select the N-most cases which are close in size for evaluation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "a593bac4",
