   "id": "28359ffc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Understanding this file format: \n",
    "- so the file 1562337136_001b.wav_OrcaSound_orcasound_lab_33856.wav has following structure: \n",
    "    - 1562337136_001b.wav - original file name\n",
    "    - OrcaSound - provider\n",
    "    - orcasound_lab - dataset\n",
    "    - 33856 - row entry in the annotations file"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b4d07445",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Check how many flac vs wav files there are in the original eval files."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "756b0d6b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "2398"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 12,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "split_file = lambda x: x.split(\".wav\")[0] if (x.find(\".flac\") < 0) or (x.find(\".wav\") < x.find(\".flac\")) else x.split(\".flac\")[0]\n",
    "paper_eval_files = birdnet01_DCLDE_eval[\"File\"].apply(split_file)\n",
    "len(set(paper_eval_files))\n"
   ]
  },
