  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dd1612fc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Key Finding Surrounding the New Holdout Set:\n",
    "- The integer key at the end of the files is in fact an arbitrary number not a reference to the main annotations.csv file. \n",
    "    - god this database really should have a uid associated for each entry in the annotations file. \n",
    "    - in order to address this, we must reconstruct the holdout_eval from the birdnetevaluation set afterall. \n",
    "    - if it is impossible we know that there wasnt a huge amount of meaning behind the split, all we know is the samples which were definitely used for training, and the 80/20 split appeared to just be programmatically splitting the data in this way, so we can pretty safely just replicate the stratification split. \n",
    "\n",
    "First check will be to look into the birdnet eval set to see what we can reproduce from it:\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8caa2eb7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Correct Holdout Reconstruction\n",
    "\n",
    "`annotations_index` parsed from `birdnet01_DCLDE_eval[\"File\"]` is not a row-index into `Annotations.csv` (proof: sorted values == `range(34674)`) — it's an artifact of the extraction pipeline. Match on `Soundfile` instead."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 44,
   "id": "eaa2627b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "35,627 rows\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import re\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "PROVIDERS = ['OrcaSound','DFO_WDA','JASCO_VFPA','DFO_CRP','SMRUConsulting','ONC','SIO','SIMRES','UAF']\n",
    "PAT = re.compile(r'^(.+?\\.(?:wav|flac))_(' + '|'.join(PROVIDERS) + r')_', re.IGNORECASE)\n",
    "\n",
    "eval_stems = set(\n",
    "    birdnet01_DCLDE_eval[\"File\"]\n",
    "    .apply(lambda f: Path(m.group(1)).stem.lower() if (m := PAT.match(f)) else None)\n",
    "    .dropna()\n",
    ")\n",
    "anno_stems = annotations_w_calltypes[\"Soundfile\"].apply(lambda s: Path(s).stem.lower())\n",
    "\n",
    "holdout_eval_correct = annotations_w_calltypes[anno_stems.isin(eval_stems)].reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "holdout_eval_correct.to_csv(\n",
    "    \"./reconstructed_splits/holdout_eval.csv\",\n",
    "    index=False,\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(f\"{len(holdout_eval_correct):,} rows\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 45,
   "id": "e2d22505",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "file overlap: 1.0\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
